WEBVTT

00:14.200 --> 00:15.600
Perhaps

00:15.880 --> 00:17.480
Chancellor Chen was right

00:35.280 --> 00:36.680
Do it cleanly

00:38.200 --> 00:39.600
How it's handled

00:39.880 --> 00:41.547
No need to tell me

00:42.040 --> 00:42.720
Your subject

00:42.880 --> 00:44.880
Bids farewell to the Crown Prince

00:50.560 --> 00:51.840
Let's go

00:51.920 --> 00:53.320
Let's go somewhere else

00:55.000 --> 01:06.000
According to palace attendants, the Emperor smashed the palace lantern on his desk in fury, aggravating his illness. He decreed Prince Ning as regent and refused to see anyone.

